`1-100`: _⚡ Quick win_

**Add test coverage for AcceptInvite method.**

The test suite covers `ListMembers`, `AddMember`, and `RemoveMember` authorization and validation, but `AcceptInvite` has no test coverage. Since `AcceptInvite` is one of the four methods implemented in this PR (per PR objectives), it should have at least basic authorization/validation tests following the same pattern as the existing tests.




<details>
<summary>💡 Suggested test structure for AcceptInvite</summary>

```go
// TestAcceptInviteValidation verifies the auth/validation behavior.
func TestAcceptInviteValidation(t *testing.T) {
	s := &TenantService{}
	// Test case: verify method can be called with matching userID/tenantID
	// (will fail at DB layer with nil DAO, but validates the method signature and basic flow)
	code, err := s.AcceptInvite("user-abc", "tenant-xyz")
	// Assert expected error behavior based on service implementation
	// Add additional validation tests as needed
}
```

</details>

**Optional:** Consider adding positive test cases with mocked DAOs to validate successful operations, though the current authorization-focused tests provide good value.

